  <name>Beyrix</name>
  <summary>Experimental Wayland terminal emulator</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Beyrix is an experimental terminal emulator for Linux and Wayland. It
      renders with OpenGL ES through EGL and falls back to a software renderer
      when hardware acceleration is unavailable.
    </p>
    <p>
      The project is alpha quality, supports x86_64 Wayland sessions only and
      provides a PTY-backed Bash session plus a small built-in editor.
    </p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.beykus_y.Beyrix.desktop</launchable>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/Beykus-Y/Beyrix</url>
